---
import { friendsConfig } from '../../config/friends';

const officialRows = friendsConfig.categories.flatMap((cat) =>
  cat.items.map((item) => ({
    ...item,
    categoryName: cat.name,
  }))
);
---

<section class="status-directory-section" aria-label="公开生态友邻名录与离线申请指引">
  <details class="status-details">
    <summary>
      <span>展开查看当前已收录的关联生态与友邻名录（共 {officialRows.length} 项）</span>
      <span class="status-details__chevron" aria-hidden="true">▸</span>
    </summary>
    <div class="status-details__body">
      <p style="margin:0.65rem 0;">
        以下条目源自仓库配置文件 <code>src/config/friends.ts</code>（当前公开基线；新申请须经站长人工核验并合入配置后才会出现在此处及 <a href="/friends/">友人帐</a>）。
      </p>
      <div class="status-table-wrap">
        <table class="status-data-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>站点名称</th>
              <th>定位与简介</th>
              <th>分类</th>
              <th>状态</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {officialRows.map((row) => (
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a href={row.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="doc-link--external">
                    {row.name}
                  </a>
                </td>
                <td>{row.desc}</td>
                <td>{row.tag || '生态'}</td>
                <td><span class="ev-badge ev-badge--source">静态收录</span></td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </details>

  <noscript>
    <div class="status-callout status-callout--warn" style="margin-top:1rem;">
      <p class="status-callout__title">当前浏览器未启用 JavaScript</p>
      <p>
        嵌入式 <strong>Microsoft Forms</strong> 交互问卷需要 JavaScript 渲染；您仍可通过邮件发送站点名称、<code>https://</code> 外链网址、头像链接与简介至
        <a href="mailto:shijianus@epocanvas.com">shijianus@epocanvas.com</a> 提交互链申请。
      </p>
    </div>
  </noscript>
</section>
